### Component Specifications

> 🚫 All interactive elements use `@emisgroup/ui-*` exclusively.

**Annotation Type Toolbar:**
- Container: `<div role="group" aria-label={t('annotations.toolbar.label')}>` flex row
- Tool buttons: `Button variant="mono"` for Highlight, Comment, Drawing
- Active tool: `Button variant="filled"` (selected state); `aria-pressed="true"`
- Each button: `ariaLabel` = `{t('annotations.tool.highlight')}` etc.

**Add-Annotation Form:**
- Shown/hidden by CSS `display:none` → block when tool selected; `aria-expanded` on toolbar button
- Comment textarea: `Textarea aria-label={t('annotations.comment.label')} placeholder={t('annotations.comment.placeholder')} rows={4}`
- Patient visibility: `Select aria-label={t('annotations.patientVisibility.label')}` with options: "Not visible to patient (default)" / "Visible to patient"
- Default: "Not visible to patient" — MANDATORY (IG-002, HAZ-DOC-023)
- Save: `Button variant="filled"` `{t('annotations.save')}`
- Cancel: `Button variant="mono"` `{t('annotations.cancel')}`

**Annotation List Item:**
- Container: `<article aria-label={t('annotations.item.label', { author, date })}>` per annotation
- System-origin badge: `Badge variant="primary"` "EMIS-X" — always visible; cannot be removed from display
- Author: `<strong>{author.displayName}</strong>` + role `<span className="text-dim">` + timestamp
- Content: rendered as text (HTML-escaped); highlight content shows with `background: var(--cautionary)` tint
- Actions: `Button variant="mono" size="small" circular` 3-dot menu → Edit / Delete (own annotations only; admin can delete any)

**EMIS Web Boundary Notice:**
- Component: `Banner variant="warning"` with `dismissible={false}` (or equivalent non-dismissable prop)
- Must include: heading + count of EMIS Web annotations + "Open in EMIS Web →" `Button variant="mono"` + footer attribution text (CLIN-007 · HAZ-DOC-021 · MIT-DOC-020)
- Rendered on every document open where EMIS Web annotations count > 0
- Position: top of annotation panel, above add-annotation toolbar

**Annotation Delete Confirmation:**
- `Dialog` (standard, not preventBackdropClose)
- Copy: `{t('annotations.delete.confirm')}` — confirms annotation will be permanently removed; author details shown
- Confirm: `Button variant="danger"` `{t('annotations.delete.confirm.action')}`
- Cancel: `Button variant="mono"`

