### Interaction Patterns

**Text selection → Highlight:**
- Clinician selects text in viewer; `mouseup` triggers highlight affordance (floating `Button variant="mono" size="small"`)
- Click "Highlight" → text wrapped in `<mark>` with highlight style; annotation entry created; panel scrolls to new entry

**Annotation form lifecycle:**
- Tool click → form animates in (`max-height` 0 → auto, 200ms ease-out); focus moves to textarea (Comment) or auto-applies (Highlight)
- Save → form collapses; `Notification variant="success"` auto-dismiss 5s
- Cancel → form collapses; no annotation created; focus returns to tool button

**Keyboard navigation:**
- Tab into annotation panel; Tab navigates toolbar → form fields → list items
- Escape while form open: collapses form (same as Cancel)
- Enter on annotation list item: expands/collapses full text

