### Failure Modes & Resilience

1. Dependency timeout or unavailable: Circuit breaker and bounded retries with explicit fail-closed UX.
2. Message duplication or replay: Idempotency keys and dedupe checks at persistence boundaries.
3. Partial write risk: Transactional outbox or compensating action with audit evidence.
4. EMIS Web downstream outage: Queue and replay integration calls with no silent data loss.

